{"1761910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Athanasia", "steam_appid": 1761910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Athanasia</strong> is an immersive horror FPS set in an abandoned South American research facility overrun with prehistoric predators. Inspired by classics like System Shock and Dino Crisis, Athanasia challenges players to outthink and outmanoeuvre the brute strength of your ancient adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Carmen Flores, researcher and explorer, called to investigate a mysterious facility in South America where reports of disappearances and strange phenomena abound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within this winding maze of secrets and science lies a terrible truth alongside ancestral nightmares that have plagued us for longer than we have been human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will you survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits and your equipment to navigate hidden pathways and uncover forgotten secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of your surroundings to escape deadly encounters or destroy unwitting foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find caches of vital equipment and uncover the audio logs of those who lived, worked and died in this forsaken place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/70149200be31a9abe6743b4ce2379767.poster.avif?t=1780242650\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/70149200be31a9abe6743b4ce2379767.webm?t=1780242650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/70149200be31a9abe6743b4ce2379767.mp4?t=1780242650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here be monsters; from the creatures that once ruled the world, to <strong>[Redacted]</strong> unfamiliar to human eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an arsenal of nifty tools and deadly weapons. Combine resources to create healing items, distractions, or traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are strong… but you are smart. Prove that humans are the apex of our era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/e9306eea411df0d4ed5a070c66cb76d1.poster.avif?t=1780242650\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/e9306eea411df0d4ed5a070c66cb76d1.webm?t=1780242650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/e9306eea411df0d4ed5a070c66cb76d1.mp4?t=1780242650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack into computers, jimmy open doors, and refuel machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak, stalk, and outwit your foes in tense, hair-trigger encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conserve your resources and pick your fights.  Underestimate the enemy at your peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/02e63a483dd84e0e86374bc107fadd4b.poster.avif?t=1780242650\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/02e63a483dd84e0e86374bc107fadd4b.webm?t=1780242650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/02e63a483dd84e0e86374bc107fadd4b.mp4?t=1780242650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Athanasia</strong> is an immersive horror FPS set in an abandoned South American research facility overrun with prehistoric predators. Inspired by classics like System Shock and Dino Crisis, Athanasia challenges players to outthink and outmanoeuvre the brute strength of your ancient adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Carmen Flores, researcher and explorer, called to investigate a mysterious facility in South America where reports of disappearances and strange phenomena abound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within this winding maze of secrets and science lies a terrible truth alongside ancestral nightmares that have plagued us for longer than we have been human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will you survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits and your equipment to navigate hidden pathways and uncover forgotten secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of your surroundings to escape deadly encounters or destroy unwitting foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find caches of vital equipment and uncover the audio logs of those who lived, worked and died in this forsaken place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/70149200be31a9abe6743b4ce2379767.poster.avif?t=1780242650\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/70149200be31a9abe6743b4ce2379767.webm?t=1780242650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/70149200be31a9abe6743b4ce2379767.mp4?t=1780242650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here be monsters; from the creatures that once ruled the world, to <strong>[Redacted]</strong> unfamiliar to human eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an arsenal of nifty tools and deadly weapons. Combine resources to create healing items, distractions, or traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are strong… but you are smart. Prove that humans are the apex of our era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/e9306eea411df0d4ed5a070c66cb76d1.poster.avif?t=1780242650\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/e9306eea411df0d4ed5a070c66cb76d1.webm?t=1780242650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/e9306eea411df0d4ed5a070c66cb76d1.mp4?t=1780242650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack into computers, jimmy open doors, and refuel machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak, stalk, and outwit your foes in tense, hair-trigger encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conserve your resources and pick your fights.  Underestimate the enemy at your peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/02e63a483dd84e0e86374bc107fadd4b.poster.avif?t=1780242650\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/02e63a483dd84e0e86374bc107fadd4b.webm?t=1780242650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/extras/02e63a483dd84e0e86374bc107fadd4b.mp4?t=1780242650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Explore a mysterious facility and use everything you have to survive. Use an arsenal of equipment and your wits against time traveling predators from the past.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/header.jpg?t=1780242650", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780242650", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780242650", "website": "https://www.momentumgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4GHZ Dual Core Processor Or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 660 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Direc